  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、今日はスカウトに集中だ\r\n町中から……公園の方も回ろう）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010010,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "あの……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "016",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101600002/1016001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（とにかく足を使うんだ\r\n無駄な時間なんてないぞ……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010020,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "──あの、すみません",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600002/1016001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よしっ！　……え？\r\n……お、俺ですか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010030,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "はい。突然声をかけたりして、すみません\r\n袖のボタンが落ちそうで、気になってしまって……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600002/1016001010030",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ？\r\n……あ、本当だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すみません……ありがとうございます\r\n恥ずかしいところを見られちゃって……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010040,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "ふふ、いいえ～",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600002/1016001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははは……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（なんだろう……この人の笑顔、すごく優しいなぁ……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010050,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "あの……よかったら、私に直させてもらえませんか？\r\n裁縫道具を持ってるんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600002/1016001010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ……いやいや！\r\nそんなことまでしてもらうわけには──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010060,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "でも、もう落ちちゃいそうですよ……？\r\nどうぞ、ご遠慮なさらず",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600002/1016001010060",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃ、じゃあ……\r\nお願いしちゃってもいいですか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010070,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "ええ\r\nちょっと失礼しますね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600002/1016001010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（つ、ついお願いしてしまった……\r\n笑顔に、つられちゃうんだよなあ……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010080,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "はい、できました♪",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600002/1016001010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（自然とあったかい気持ちになるというか……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010090,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600002/1016001010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あっ……おおっ、あっという間ですね……！\r\n本当に、なんとお礼を言っていいか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010100,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "いいえ、お役に立てて良かったです\r\nそれじゃあ、私はこれで……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600002/1016001010100",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あっ、ちょっと──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ……ええと……突然すみませんが……\r\nアイドルになってみませんか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010110,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "えっ？\r\nアイドル、ですか？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600002/1016001010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "びっくりされましたよね、すみません",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "実は俺、アイドルのプロデューサーをやっていて\r\n新人アイドルをスカウト中なんです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こんなところで急に、と思われるかもしれませんが……\r\nどうしてもあなたに惹きつけられてしまって！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010120,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "え、ええと……そう、なんですね\r\n……でも、ごめんなさい",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600002/1016001010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010130,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "私、雑貨屋に勤めているんです\r\n今の仕事が好きですし……そういうのは、ちょっと",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600002/1016001010130",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "雑貨屋に……そうですか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、その……今の仕事を、辞めなくても構いません\r\nお休みの日に、まずはレッスンだけでも！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010140,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "いえ……そんな急に……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600002/1016001010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "では、お話だけでも！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010150,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "あの……\r\nどうしてそこまで、私のことを？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600002/1016001010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あなたなら、きっと素敵なアイドルになれると思うんです\r\nあなたの笑顔は、たくさんの人たちを元気づけられます！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010160,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "たくさんの人たちを……私が……？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600002/1016001010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はい！\r\nだから……どうか、お願いします！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010170,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……そこまで、言っていただけるなんて……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600002/1016001010170",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010180,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "その……少し、お返事を待ってもらえるでしょうか\r\nちゃんと、考えてみますから",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600002/1016001010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろんです！　これ、事務所の連絡先なんですけど……\r\nいつでも待っていますから、連絡してください",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
