  {
    "id": 1016001010190,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "あの……\r\nすみません、桑山千雪といいますが……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "016",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600002/1016001010190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あっ！\r\nお待ちしていました、どうぞ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それで……\r\n急かすようですみません、この間の返事なんですが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010200,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はい\r\nスカウトのお誘い……受けさせてもらいます",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600002/1016001010200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ほ、本当ですか！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010210,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はい。自分には思いもよらないお話ですけど、\r\n「たくさんの人を笑顔に」って言葉が、忘れられなくて",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600002/1016001010210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010220,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "今のお仕事を続けながらでよろしければ……\r\nレッスンから、チャレンジさせてください",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600002/1016001010220",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろんです！\r\n……全力でサポートします！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001010230,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "まあ……！　ありがとうございます\r\nよろしくお願いしますね、プロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
